  "description": "<p data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"380\">De iconische stealth-klassiekers in high-definition: <strong data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"185\">Metal Gear Solid HD Collection</strong> voor de <strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"235\">PlayStation 3</strong>.<br data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"239\">Deze collectie bevat HD-versies van meerdere legendarische Metal Gear Solid-titels en is <strong data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"352\">nog volledig geseald</strong> — ideaal voor verzamelaars.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"474\"><strong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"392\">Staat:</strong><br data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"395\">✔️ <strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"426\">Nieuw & geseald (sealed)</strong><br data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"429\">✔️ Ongeopend<br data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"444\">✔️ Verzamelwaardig exemplaar</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"573\"><strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"487\">Inhoud:</strong><br data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"490\">• Originele game(s) in HD Collection<br data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"529\">• Originele seal intact<br data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"555\">• Originele hoes</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"735\"><strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"595\">Waarom dit item?</strong><br data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"598\">• Zeer geliefde Metal Gear-titels in HD<br data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"640\">• Perfect voor verzamelaars<br data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"670\">• Tijdloze stealth-gameplay<br data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"700\">• Steeds lastiger nieuw te vinden</p>",
